{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ECHO CORE</strong> is a top-down sci-fi action-adventure. You awaken deep within an abandoned facility, now silent and overgrown. Its halls hide both beauty and danger, and the answers to who and what you really are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through hostile machines with responsive, ability-driven combat. Explore richly atmospheric levels that tell the story of a world divided, now long forgotten. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense top-down combat</strong> with responsive controls and special abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemy encounters that evolve</strong> as you progress deeper into the facility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric exploration</strong> filled with secrets, lore, and environmental storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three distinct acts</strong>, each with new challenges and environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized visuals</strong> enhanced by atmospheric lighting and effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible length</strong> designed for a focused, satisfying playthrough.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3956590?t=1769469690","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956590/1239ab1b52d870e403505b961d88990a6ee86dc3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769469690","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956590/4e7daac3913222e8d5ad36959a954b904c08cbdf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769469690","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956590/4e7daac3913222e8d5ad36959a954b904c08cbdf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769469690","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ECHO CORE</strong> is a top-down sci-fi action-adventure. You awaken deep within an abandoned facility, now silent and overgrown. Its halls hide both beauty and danger, and the answers to who and what you really are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through hostile machines with responsive, ability-driven combat. Explore richly atmospheric levels that tell the story of a world divided, now long forgotten. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense top-down combat</strong> with responsive controls and special abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemy encounters that evolve</strong> as you progress deeper into the facility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric exploration</strong> filled with secrets, lore, and environmental storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three distinct acts</strong>, each with new challenges and environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized visuals</strong> enhanced by atmospheric lighting and effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible length</strong> designed for a focused, satisfying playthrough.</p></li></ul>","developers":["LEVEL 126"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956590/9fa4a232f3d798796f9124eb5b09118587c8e1c2/header.jpg?t=1769469690","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trail